 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 3.12pt; text-align: left;"><span style="padding-left: 12.5pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 36.89pt; height: 12.75pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0.66pt; text-align: left;"><span style="padding-left: 25.56pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 35.99pt; height: 12.75pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1.75pt; text-align: left;">101,250<sup>(7)</sup></div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 56.86pt; height: 12.75pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 9.69pt; text-align: left;">$139,725 </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.89pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;